stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Planned
 Planned --> DryRun
 DryRun --> Blocked: incompatible WORM/Version/region
 DryRun --> Approved: separate operator approval
 Approved --> BulkCopy
 BulkCopy --> DeltaCatchup
 DeltaCatchup --> Verify
 Verify --> Blocked: sha/version/lock mismatch
 Verify --> WriteFence
 WriteFence --> FinalDelta
 FinalDelta --> CutoverCAS
 CutoverCAS --> Observing
 Observing --> RetireApproved: protected source retention expires/approval
 Observing --> ReverseCatchup: request rollback after ACKed new writes
 ReverseCatchup --> WriteFenceBack
 WriteFenceBack --> CutoverBackCAS: all target writes accounted
 ReverseCatchup --> Blocked: cannot catch up
 CutoverBackCAS --> Observing
 RetireApproved --> Complete
 Complete --> [*]
